---
Remove -w (suppress all warnings) from plugin targets.

Plugin build targets use -w which hides all compiler warnings.
Remove it and fix any resulting warnings.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] -w flag removed from plugin CMake targets
- [ ] Plugin code compiles warning-free with -Wall -Wextra
- [ ] Any new warnings fixed (not suppressed)

## Test Plan
- [ ] Build plugin targets without -w, verify clean compilation
- [ ] Verify plugin still functions correctly after warning fixes
